From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 05:46:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Stop the account card repeating its own name

Account opened a card whose first entry was another Account (issue #65,
decision 9). The card already holds real choices (Sign out on every
desk, Retire on the Lightkeeper's), so it stays a menu, and its way to
the account page now reads "Edit account". DESIGN.md and AUTH.md say so.

Checked: vite build; in Chromium at 390x844, 820x1180 and 1366x768 on
the hub, the investigator's desk (the drawer on a phone) and the
Lightkeeper's desk, the card lists Edit account and Sign out (and Retire
on the Lightkeeper's), and Edit account opens /account with no page
errors.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01ETKqHLvkfH9k99JTnJzzKA
